[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727647043","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104180#issuecomment-2727647043","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104180","id":2727647043,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ilJdD","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-16T21:06:49Z","updated_at":"2025-03-16T21:06:49Z","body":"Thank you for the detailed report and the minimal reproduction projects. This is definitely something we need to look into.\n\nIt looks like the cause is calling the `Set` method. When the method is called on a Node/Resource that has a script attached, it will also call the `_set` virtual method implemented by the script. That's why the behavior is different when you subclass `AnimationTree`.\n\nIn C#, calling the `_set` virtual method means we end up allocating a new `StringName` instance to pass it to the `_Set` virtual method:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0028fd625e2c5b202e204bc12828cbca043213d3/modules/mono/glue/GodotSharp/GodotSharp/Core/Bridge/CSharpInstanceBridge.cs#L62-L67\n\nThis is unfortunate because your script doesn't actually override `_Set` so it'd be great if we could avoid it. We may be able to check if the C# instance overrides `_Set` with reflection, but that may break trimming scenarios (i.e. NativeAOT).\n\nYou may be able to avoid `Set` entirely if you can access the `AnimationNode` and call `SetParameter` instead, maybe we can expose a `SetParameter` method in `AnimationTree` or `AnimationMixer` that bypasses the `_set` virtual method.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727647043/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727649922","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104180#issuecomment-2727649922","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104180","id":2727649922,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ilKKC","user":{"login":"TinkerWorX","id":1730988,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzA5ODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1730988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinkerWorX","html_url":"https://github.com/TinkerWorX","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinkerWorX/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinkerWorX/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinkerWorX/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinkerWorX/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinkerWorX/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinkerWorX/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinkerWorX/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinkerWorX/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinkerWorX/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-16T21:14:44Z","updated_at":"2025-03-16T21:14:44Z","body":"Looks like I can access `AnimationTree.TreeRoot` which has a SetParameter method, so that should do the trick for now. I appreciate the suggestion.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727649922/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2729554451","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104180#issuecomment-2729554451","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104180","id":2729554451,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6isbIT","user":{"login":"TinkerWorX","id":1730988,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzA5ODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1730988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinkerWorX","html_url":"https://github.com/TinkerWorX","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinkerWorX/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinkerWorX/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinkerWorX/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinkerWorX/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinkerWorX/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinkerWorX/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinkerWorX/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinkerWorX/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TinkerWorX/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T13:40:33Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T13:40:33Z","body":"I tested using the `AnimationTree.TreeRoot` and then using SetParameter, but I get the following error:\n```\nERROR: Parameter \"process_state\" is null.\n   at: set_parameter (scene/animation/animation_tree.cpp:73)\n```\nI'll just hold off subclassing for now, and then await a potential fix.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2729554451/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2753525544","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104180#issuecomment-2753525544","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104180","id":2753525544,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kH3co","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-26T08:01:49Z","updated_at":"2025-03-26T08:01:49Z","body":"Can we give an alternative lower-level API for this special case (`_get`, `_set`) to enable the developer to cache the allocations?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2753525544/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2755667983","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104180#issuecomment-2755667983","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104180","id":2755667983,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kQCgP","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-26T20:24:24Z","updated_at":"2025-03-26T20:24:24Z","body":"@Delsin-Yu I'm not sure what you mean, the developer is already using a cached `StringName` in this case:\n\n```csharp\npublic partial class SpecialAnimationTree : AnimationTree\n{\n    private static readonly StringName IdleBlendPosition = \"parameters/Idle/blend_position\";\n\n    public void Update(...)\n    {\n        Set(IdleBlendPosition, ...);\n    }\n}\n```\n\nDid you mean providing a new API that calls `set` without calling the virtual `_set` method?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2755667983/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2756730571","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104180#issuecomment-2756730571","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104180","id":2756730571,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kUF7L","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-27T05:21:27Z","updated_at":"2025-03-27T17:47:48Z","body":"> Did you mean providing a new API that calls set without calling the virtual _set method?\n\nActually, after checking the source code, I think it is possible to optimize away the StringName allocations in `CSInstanceBridge.set` and `CSInstanceBridge.get` without introduces new API (only two publicly visible boolean flags), we can use the source generator to detect whether the user has overridden this method and generate an override boolean property getter to store this information for runtime evaluation.\n\n```csharp\n[UnmanagedCallersOnly]\ninternal static unsafe godot_bool Set(IntPtr godotObjectGCHandle, godot_string_name* name, godot_variant* value)\n{\n    try\n    {\n        var godotObject = (GodotObject)GCHandle.FromIntPtr(godotObjectGCHandle).Target;\n\n        if (godotObject == null)\n            throw new InvalidOperationException();\n\n        if (godotObject.SetGodotClassPropertyValue(CustomUnsafe.AsRef(name), CustomUnsafe.AsRef(value)))\n        {\n            return godot_bool.True;\n        }\n\n        if (!godotObject.HasCustomSetMethod) // Overriden by source generator in user scripts\n        {\n            return godot_bool.False;\n        }\n\n        var nameManaged = StringName.CreateTakingOwnershipOfDisposableValue(\n            NativeFuncs.godotsharp_string_name_new_copy(CustomUnsafe.AsRef(name)));\n\n        Variant valueManaged = Variant.CreateCopyingBorrowed(*value);\n\n        return godotObject._Set(nameManaged, valueManaged).ToGodotBool();\n    }\n    catch (Exception e)\n    {\n        ExceptionUtils.LogException(e);\n        return godot_bool.False;\n    }\n}\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2756730571/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3922003999","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104180#issuecomment-3922003999","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104180","id":3922003999,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pxQgf","user":{"login":"AdamLearns","id":60950402,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwOTUwNDAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60950402?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns","html_url":"https://github.com/AdamLearns","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-18T17:02:33Z","updated_at":"2026-02-18T17:02:33Z","body":"I just hit this issue with tweens on `v4.4.1.stable.mono.official [49a5bc7b6]` (which is almost certainly going to cause me to update to the newest version of Godot, but I wanted this to be searchable by people in the future with the queries that I used).\n\nI wasn't subclassing `AnimationTree` but instead simply making a `Tween`. The repro is incredibly simple:\n\n- Make a node with a C# script\n- Make a single `Tween` that calls `TweenProperty` on that node over a very long duration\n\nHere's the minimal repro: [TweenAllocationRepro.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25396095/TweenAllocationRepro.zip)\n\nAgain, I want to be clear that this _was_ already fixed by #104689; this comment is just to help other people find this issue in the future.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3922003999/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]